TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Böyle bomboş bir sergi salonu {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
halkını biraz utandırıyordur.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Her zaman gelmek zorunda değilsin,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
ama umarım yakında daha çok bağış
alırız,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Vay, bu canlıların çok uzun zaman
önce dünyada dolaştığını hayal etmek zor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
değil mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Te has fijado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Nuestra colección está completa.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}
¡Es el equipo olímpico de los fósiles!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Me apostaría algo a que no hay otro
museo capaz de competir con el
nuestro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}, esta colección no te va
a impresionar.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0013:}}No destaca por su
abundancia precisamente{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si quieres ver algo impresionante,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}¡será mejor que te fijes en el
conjunto que luzco hoy!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Rimarrai delus{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} nel vedere
questa sala,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Ci sono pochissimi fossili{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma visto che hai fatto tutta questa
strada...{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:002C:}}forse ti puoi consolare
dando un'occhiatina al sottoscritto!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¿Completaréis antes que nosotros
vuestra colección de fósiles?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿O ganaremos nosotros,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}The fossil hall in this town is sort of
like an all-star team of fossils!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}We have every single one right here.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It looks quite good, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Please
take your time looking around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Die Fossilienausstellung in dieser
Stadt ist perfekt!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Sozusagen ein
All-Star-Team der Urzeit!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das kann sich sehen lassen, oder?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Sieh dich in Ruhe um,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Bu kasabanın fosil salonu resmen
fosillerden yıldızlar takımı gibi!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Her birinden burada var.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Gayet iyi görünüyor, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Acele etmeden gez,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
